{"words": [{"text": "تَرَىٰ", "translation": "You see"}, {"text": "كَثِيرًۭا", "translation": "many"}, {"text": "مِّنْهُمْ", "translation": "of them"}, {"text": "يَتَوَلَّوْنَ", "translation": "taking as allies"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "كَفَرُوا۟ ۚ", "translation": "disbelieved"}, {"text": "لَبِئْسَ", "translation": "Surely evil"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "(is) what"}, {"text": "قَدَّمَتْ", "translation": "sent forth"}, {"text": "لَهُمْ", "translation": "for them"}, {"text": "أَنفُسُهُمْ", "translation": "their souls"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "سَخِطَ", "translation": "became angry"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِمْ", "translation": "with them"}, {"text": "وَفِى", "translation": "and in"}, {"text": "ٱلْعَذَابِ", "translation": "the punishment"}, {"text": "هُمْ", "translation": "they"}, {"text": "خَـٰلِدُونَ", "translation": "(will) abide forever"}], "sahih": "You see many of them becoming allies of those who disbelieved [i.e., the polytheists]. How wretched is that which they have put forth for themselves in that Allāh has become angry with them, and in the punishment they will abide eternally."}